{"id":67435,"date":"2025-08-29T08:24:37","date_gmt":"2025-08-29T07:24:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=67435"},"modified":"2026-09-27T22:29:11","modified_gmt":"2026-09-27T21:29:11","slug":"sao-silvestre-de-jam","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-de-jam\/","title":{"rendered":"S\u00e3o Silvestre de JAM 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre de JAM 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre de JAM 2026<\/strong> (8\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>5 de Dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, na vila de <strong>Mozelos<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Santa Maria da Feira<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Aveiro<\/strong>. Organizada pela <strong>Juventude Atl\u00e9tica Mozelense (JAM)<\/strong> com a colabora\u00e7\u00e3o do Munic\u00edpio de Santa Maria da Feira e da Junta de Freguesia de Mozelos, a prova alia o esp\u00edrito desportivo de fim de ano \u00e0 solidariedade e ao conv\u00edvio comunit\u00e1rio.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com centro nevr\u00e1lgico junto ao <strong>Pavilh\u00e3o Desportivo de Mozelos<\/strong> (Travessa Jos\u00e9 Santos Cardoso), o programa desportivo oferece a <strong>Corrida de 8,6 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>18:00<\/strong> (2 voltas a um circuito urbano r\u00e1pido) e a <strong>Caminhada Solid\u00e1ria de 4,3 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>18:15<\/strong> (1 volta ao circuito), revertendo parte do valor da caminhada (2\u20ac) para uma causa social da comunidade.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza balne\u00e1rios com duches quentes no pavilh\u00e3o desportivo, entrega de pr\u00e9mios individuais e coletivos, bem como um acolhedor conv\u00edvio p\u00f3s-prova com caldo verde e f\u00eavera para todos os atletas inscritos.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span clas